silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_03_materialization_spine_sections_03_validate_step_concrete_anchor_6#vetrecordaboutmittens silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecordAboutMittens is The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'RawSourceWitness', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
